","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003724","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji063-003","person_id":"cbr-p003724","title":"周太史","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","source_id":"s-shiji-063-laohan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p006","quote":"自孔子死之後百二十九年，而史記周太史儋見秦獻公曰：「始秦與周合，合五百歲而離，離七十歲而霸王者出焉。」或曰儋即老子，或曰非也，世莫知其然否。老子，隱君子也。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji063-003:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p006","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"周太史","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:m006-0015","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依來源用稱保存，公號與帝稱不當生前已授同字諡稱；引例保留敘事範圍，不據首次用稱或死亡補任期。制度未定用稱保留未分類。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji063-005","person_id":"cbr-p003724","surfaces":["儋","周太史儋"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-063-laohan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p006","quote":"自孔子死之後百二十九年，而史記周太史儋見秦獻公曰：「始秦與周合，合五百歲而離，離七十歲而霸王者出焉。」或曰儋即老子，或曰非也，世莫知其然否。老子，隱君子也。"}],"rationale":"依開篇姓名與敘事局部短稱暫接，未名引例人物不補名。老萊子及太史儋與老子分候選不表示確定不同，書名與否定非字不當人物提及，故事與身份確證分開。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji063-dan","person_ids":["cbr-p000286","cbr-p003724"],"canonical_person_id":"cbr-p000286","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin","c-shiji-063-laohan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p054","quote":"獻公元年，止從死。二年，城櫟陽。四年正月庚寅，孝公生。十一年，周太史儋見獻公曰：「周故與秦國合而別，別五百歲復合，合（七）十七歲而霸王出。」十六年，桃冬花。十八年，雨金櫟陽。二十一年，與晉戰於石門，斬首六萬，天子賀以黼黻。二十三年，與魏晉戰少梁，虜其將公孫痤。二十四年，獻公卒，子孝公立，年已二十一歲矣。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-005-qin:m054-0031"]},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan","source_id":"s-shiji-063-laohan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-063-laohan:p006","quote":"自孔子死之後百二十九年，而史記周太史儋見秦獻公曰：「始秦與周合，合五百歲而離，離七十歲而霸王者出焉。」或曰儋即老子，或曰非也，世莫知其然否。老子，隱君子也。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-063-laohan:m006-0015","c-shiji-063-laohan:m006-0053"]}],"rationale":"兩篇同記周太史儋見秦獻公並述秦周離合預言，事件相配。五百歲、七十歲與合（七）十七歲等各存見證，不校改或因此判儋即老子。 已發ID與原文保留，同書不同篇不當獨立見證；身份暫接不等於史實、年表或來源優先已定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p070","text":"安王立二十六年，崩，子烈王喜立。烈王二年，周太史儋見秦獻公曰：「始周與秦國合而別，別五百載復合，合十七歲而霸王者出焉。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m070-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"安王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000283","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m070-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"烈王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000285","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m070-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"烈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000285","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m070-0021","start":21,"end":25,"surface":"周太史儋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000286","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m070-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"秦獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000287","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p054","text":"獻公元年，止從死。二年，城櫟陽。四年正月庚寅，孝公生。十一年，周太史儋見獻公曰：「周故與秦國合而別，別五百歲復合，合（七）十七歲而霸王出。」十六年，桃冬花。十八年，雨金櫟陽。二十一年，與晉戰於石門，斬首六萬，天子賀以黼黻。二十三年，與魏晉戰少梁，虜其將公孫痤。二十四年，獻公卒，子孝公立，年已二十一歲矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m054-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m054-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"孝公","kind":"perso